      "value": "Actually I think they quietly did this. I've noticed lately  that people's hands drop to their side when lying down if their controllers turn off \n\nSource :Myself on quest2, and friend on index.\n\nmaybe instead just a \"freeze position\" rather than dropping to default \"at side\" would be nice",
